        "name": "聊聊棒",
        "desc": "<p>一柄沉重的镶有黑曜石的大棒，有很强的说服力。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/16/47826599/b1773be7f0c6b80e5ca8fd4a71dbd78a_4340935892717683526.png",
